				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					546c
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσότης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					508a
				</span></i>
			; 
