					<u>EN</u>
					1131b13
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεσότης</span> Theo Sm.<i><span class="en">
				p.106
			</span></i> H., etc. (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαμετρικός</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">; ἁρμονία</span>”
