					Plu.
					2.720a
				</span></i>
			 (
				Sup.
			); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεωμετρική</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη</span>), <i>geometry</i>,
