				Nicom.Com.
				1.18
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ -κά</span> title of work on
				<i>geometry</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Democr.
				11n
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>APo.</u>
				79a9
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>
