				<u>in Prm.</u>
				p.897
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>in Ti.</u>
				1.345
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ.</span>
			<i>refellere</i>, prove wrong <i>to demonstration</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Att.</u>
				12.5.3
			</span></i>. </div>
